The bus is in Mumbai's traffic.
The traffic is very heavy.
But the bus moves forward slowly.
I look outside from the window.
There is a big metro station ahead.
The station building is made of glass.
It looks very modern.
I need to go inside this station.
The bus stops near the station.
The doors of the bus open.
I pick up my bag.
I carefully step off the bus.
Many people also step off the bus.
There is a large crowd outside near the station.
All the people walk towards the entrance.
I also join the crowd.
I walk slowly with them.
